            <description><![CDATA[<h2>More reliable investigations with Codex</h2>
<p>Doctor starts Codex investigations more reliably and retains findings between steps. Codex can consult documentation and test ideas in an isolated workspace before proposing a repair. Review the proposal before applying it through Queue → Review → Apply.</p>
<h2>Import skills from GitHub collections</h2>
<p>Paste a GitHub repository URL to discover its skills, including those in nested folders. If the repository contains several skills, choose the one to import, review it, and add it to the queue.</p>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Fractional Codex MCP timeouts work correctly</strong> — FullHouse now reads and preserves fractional startup and tool timeouts in Codex MCP configuration. Invalid timeout values report the affected field instead of being silently ignored.</li>
<li><strong>Steadier results while catalogs load</strong> — Sections in the Add window keep stable heights as catalog sources return results, preventing repeated layout jumps during loading.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
